\mathrm{O}^{2-}=8+2=10 & \mathrm{Se}^{2-}=34+2=36 & \\
\mathrm{O}, \mathrm{F} \Rightarrow \text { Period 2 } & \mathrm{Br}, \mathrm{Se} \Rightarrow \text { Period 4 } &
